# Marketing render OUTPUT now lives in this worktree so the pipeline and the 3D
# code it renders travel together (docs/MARKETING_ASSET_OVERHAUL_PLAN.md), but the
# binaries stay out of git. The scripts and marketing/shots.manifest.json ARE
# versioned — their absence is what let the asset library silently rot.
socials-kit/
*.stamp.json

